<title>YEMEN: Yemen central bank foreign assets fall in Nov.</title>
<headline>Yemen central bank foreign assets fall in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>SANAA 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yemen central bank's foreign assets fell to $969 million at end-November from $1.008 billion at end-October 1996, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the end of 1995 the bank's foreign assets were $622 million, up from $357 million at end-1994.</p>
